const pkg = getPackageJson('.');
const tree = getFolderTree('.');

console.log("📦 package.json scripts:");
console.log(pkg.scripts);

console.log("\n🗂 Project structure:");
console.log(tree);
```

Run:
```bash
node index.js
```

Even without an API key, this step will work!

